{"reviewId": "3126459_7ZOGbnbDP", "review": {"abstract": "中国资源行业和非资源行业一定出现了严重的价格和利润分化，即通过牺牲工业利润维持了世界的低通胀，进而延长了整体世界经济增长周期，以及国际资源品价格的上涨趋势，这才是真正的中国因素", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "本质上全球资源品定价权也被欧美资本把持，中国在这段时期作为后来者，又无法掌握工业品定价权，只能赚取一个低利润加工费。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "13925-14013", "createTime": 1746077888, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "3126459_7ZOGbnbDP", "userVid": 3126459, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 3126459, "name": "firstprinciple", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/XYrRG5UShDd1OS4NmWmYVvGiahSoB8vicj5rBuDzEmgHdlDvOsl7jtCScOZuryFyyUSvvBSiaqaEak/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "firstprinciple", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 11, "likes": [{"userVid": 50721447, "name": "Rachel🦁", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/SCug0ESSOH8C15PXoXSqoTtIobcEGs8lDjcncmFGyePCYKn18ibW7AwiaiaAybYmPzMjU2hoGAkiaLw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Rachel🦁", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "书虫一枚", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-200", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIn